   "source": [
    "# EDA & Hypothesis Testing on a Restaurant Tips Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "**Author:** Saksham Yadav  |  **Tools:** Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, SciPy\n",
    "\n",
    "**Goal:** Clean and explore a real-world dataset, then use statistical hypothesis tests to answer:\n",
    "1. Does the tip depend on the total bill?\n",
    "2. Do smokers and non-smokers tip a different percentage?\n",
    "3. Does the tip percentage differ by day of the week or by sex?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** `tips.csv` (244 restaurant bills; columns: total_bill, tip, sex, smoker, day, time, size). Source: seaborn-data."
   ]
  },
