     "text": [
      "total_bill: W = 0.921, p = 0.0000\n",
      "tip: W = 0.899, p = 0.0000\n",
      "tip_pct: W = 0.800, p = 0.0000\n",
      "\n",
      "With n > 200 the t-test is robust to mild non-normality (Central Limit Theorem).\n"
     ]
