   "source": [
    "### Test 2: Do smokers and non-smokers tip a different percentage?\n",
    "- H0: mean tip % is the same for smokers and non-smokers\n",
    "- H1: the means differ (two-sided Welch t-test, does not assume equal variances)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "id": "6877fa13",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-31T18:00:11.413610Z",
