   "source": [
    "### Test 4: Does tip % differ across days of the week?\n",
    "- H0: mean tip % is the same on all days\n",
    "- H1: at least one day has a different mean (one-way ANOVA)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "22e45092",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-31T18:00:11.433317Z",
